 As a Technology Designer, Networking, you will be at the core of our mission. Key responsibilities include:
 Independently lead the detailed technical design of complex projects and ensure their integrity through to production deployment;
 Act as a technical leader for analysts, delivery teams, partners, and vendors;
 Advance initiatives, clarify decisions, and constructively challenge proposed solutions;
 Design simple, standardized, secure, and self-service networking services;
